sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Dr as Driver<br/>(failed reefer)
  participant API
  participant Disp as Dispatcher<br/>(X2)
  participant Dock as Loader<br/>(X3)
  participant Dr2 as Rescue driver<br/>(X4)
  participant St as Store<br/>(X5)

  Dr->>API: Report: reefer not holding temperature
  Note over Dr: X1. Queued if offline,<br/>with a "call dispatch" button
  API->>API: Compute recovery options
  Note over API: Each option checked with the same<br/>rules as the plan: capacity, Fresh<br/>budget, trips per day, plus arrival<br/>times from the vehicle's position
  Disp->>API: Open the incident
  API-->>Disp: Options: on time / late / deferred,<br/>ruled-out options with the reason
  Disp->>API: Approve one option
  Note over Disp: A human decides.<br/>Never re-routes automatically.
  API->>API: Move chilled stops, plan v+1,<br/>events and notifications
  API-->>Dock: Urgent release card
  API-->>Dr: Plan changed: hand over the chilled stops
  API-->>Dr2: Plan changed: new trip
  API-->>St: New vehicle and arrival time,<br/>check temperature on receipt
